--- !u!114 &207
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 204}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.65, g: 0.72, b: 0.85, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 7fef2ffcae3f43a44ae3629b1e47364f, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 10
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 8
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.25
  m_Text: "<b>CGVR Viva / Physics Principles:</b>\n• <b>Vector Momentum:</b> p = m·v. Total momentum before and after sphere-cube impact is conserved: Σp_initial = Σp_final.\n• <b>Restitution (e):</b> e = -Δv_normal_after / Δv_normal_before. Kinetic energy is dissipated when e < 1.0.\n• <b>PhysX Pipeline:</b> Broad-phase BVH bounding check → Narrow-phase PCM contact manifold → Projected Gauss-Seidel constraint solver.\n• <b>Impulse (J):</b> J = ∫ F dt = Δp. Normal impulse acts along the manifold contact normal.\n• <b>Boundary Note:</b> Floor friction and wall collisions exert external forces; conservation applies strictly across the sphere-cube collision pair."
